@@ -440,8 +440,19 @@ own loader, subclass :class:`BaseLoader` and override `get_source`.
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.BaseLoader
     :members: get_source, load
 
+All builtin loaders validate malformed names before public loading and
+source access. This also applies to composite and precompiled loaders.
+Empty names, NUL, leading separators, ASCII drive prefixes and ASCII
+controls below 32 are rejected, except tab, newline and carriage return.
+Rejection raises ``TemplateNotFound`` with the original request.
+Valid names retain their existing source and loading behavior. Existing
+filesystem parent-segment checks remain stricter than basic validation.
+
+.. autofunction:: jinja2.loaders.validate_template_path
+
 Here a list of the builtin loaders Jinja provides:
 
+
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.FileSystemLoader
 
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.PackageLoader
